{
  "name": "dsh-rp-tools",
  "version": "1.15.2",
  "description": "跑团 / DM 工具插件（DeepSeek Harness）：中立随机裁决 rp_random + 按会话隔离的战役配置（世界 / 角色卡 / 随机表 / 宏表）+ 世界书与状态追踪 + 本会话图片资源库 rp_assets（收录宿主生图结果与玩家自带图，按标签/角色检索复用）+ 角色立绘位（玩家导入自己的图）+ 设置页与会话面板 + PNG 故事书（SillyTavern 角色卡）导入（世界书/卡全文/卡面落进工作区，角色与世界写进会话，自动切 dm 预设开场）。**不做图片生成** —— 需要插图时由宿主自带的 generate_image / edit_image 负责，本插件负责把结果收进资源库复用；RP 工具只在 dm 预设会话注册。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "trpg",
    "ttrpg",
    "dungeon-master",
    "roleplay"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/SiriusWJ/dsh-rp-tools.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/SiriusWJ/dsh-rp-tools#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/SiriusWJ/dsh-rp-tools/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./global-tools-defaults.js": "./lib/global-tools-defaults.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "preset",
    "docs",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ]
    }
  }
}
